  "title": "How Modern, Connected ERP Builds ROI for Local Governments",
  "summary": "For many local government leaders, the decision to modernize core financial and human resources systems can feel daunting. The upfront investment is visible, from subscription costs and implementation services to training time and change management. In comparison, staying with an existing enterprise resource planning (ERP) system may seem like a low-friction, financially sound choice. But staying with the status quo has a cost, and for many municipalities, that cost may be higher than...",
